{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "metafit-api-collection-v1",
    "name": "MetaFit API",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API REST de MetaFit — Sport Gym Sede 80.\n\n**Configuración inicial:**\n1. Crea un entorno (Environment) con la variable `base_url = http://localhost:3001`\n2. Ejecuta 'Login Admin' primero — el script automático guardará el token en `{{token}}`\n3. El resto de requests autenticadas usarán `{{token}}` automáticamente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base del backend MetaFit (desarrollo local)"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT — se rellena automáticamente al ejecutar 'Login Admin'"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🟢 Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica que el servidor y la conexión a MySQL estén activos.\n\n**Respuesta esperada 200:**\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"db\": \"MySQL conectado\", \"timestamp\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**Sin autenticación requerida.**"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK — Servidor y DB activos",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"db\": \"MySQL conectado\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-16T22:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin (carlos@metafit.com)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ Token guardado. Rol:', jsonData.user.role);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.error('❌ Login fallido:', pm.response.status, pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["console.log('🔐 Intentando login como Administrador...');"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"carlos@metafit.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Autentica al Administrador principal.\n\n**Respuesta esperada 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJ...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"email\": \"carlos@metafit.com\",\n    \"role\": \"Administrador\",\n    \"nombres\": \"Carlos\",\n    \"apellidos\": \"García\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n⚡ El token se guarda automáticamente en `{{token}}` via script post-respuesta."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Administrador autenticado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{ \"email\": \"carlos@metafit.com\", \"password\": \"Admin123!\" }"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["login"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"email\": \"carlos@metafit.com\",\n    \"role\": \"Administrador\",\n    \"nombres\": \"Carlos\",\n    \"apellidos\": \"García\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 — Credenciales inválidas",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{ \"email\": \"carlos@metafit.com\", \"password\": \"wrongpassword\" }"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["login"] }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{ \"error\": \"Correo o contraseña incorrectos\" }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Recepcionista (maria@metafit.com)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ Token Recepcionista guardado. Rol:', jsonData.user.role);",
                  "}"
                ]
